TableWidgetDataRequest.description:
Validates the dynamic query configuration for the table widget data endpoint.

The request body mirrors the TableWidgetConfigurationDTO structure:
- root: the root model to query
- columns: array of {field, aggregation?}
- query.filter: array of {field, operator, value}
- query.sort: array of {field, order, function?}
- query.scopes: object of {scope_name: params}
- limit: optional pagination limit
